        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka",
        "text": "Can ordinary people do these Originium Arts too?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_503_rang",
            "name2": "avg_npc_155_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Franka",
        "text": "Theoretically... almost anyone can learn to do Arts at some level, with enough training."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Franka",
        "text": "It's just that studying Arts takes time and effort, and that gets tied up pretty close with talent."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Franka",
        "text": "Lots of people master only the most basic Arts, even after pushing themselves a lot harder than others."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_503_rang",
            "name2": "avg_npc_155_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rangers",
        "text": "I'm a dumb old man, and I've never learned any Originium Arts."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_456_ash_1#5",
            "name2": "char_459_tachak_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ash",
        "text": "What are you thinking?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_456_ash_1#5",
            "name2": "char_459_tachak_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka",
        "text": "Nothing... Just brainstorming about our situation here... some wild, impractical ideas."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_156_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm",
        "text": "Oh, right, Mr. K\u00f6tz."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm",
        "text": "Take a look at this shield here."
    },
    {
